155
00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:17.920
I don't mean a deliverance.

156
00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:22.600
A deliverance is a lesser thing.

157
00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:25.760
An exorcism is on the level of miracle.

158
00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:32.400
And the devil will respond to a priest who has proper authority from God.

159
00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:41.160
Do you remember in the Acts of the Apostles, the sons of Scaver were acting as exorcists

160
00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:46.520
and they started trying to get the devil out of people by saying, "I command you by the

161
