Jesus whom Paul serves."

162
00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:54.480
And the devil attacked them and said, "What right do you have to command me?

163
00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:57.720
Paul is appointed by Jesus.

164
00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:58.720
You're not.

165
00:14:58.720 --> 00:14:59.960
You don't even believe in him.

166
00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.280
You just think you can use this yourselves."

167
00:15:02.280 --> 00:15:04.640
The devil just attacked them.

168
00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:11.600
So here you have Jesus giving the crucifixion to Louisa because of the authority that's

169
00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:18.240
in the priest, he recognizes it and responds to it.

170
00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:23.800
So Louisa said, "I wasn't able to resist after this, and I didn't want to for fear

171
00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:34.080
that it might not be Jesus, I'll say exactly what she says, and I no longer able to resist

172
00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:39.800
all this, which I did not want for fear that it might not be Jesus.

173
00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:45.160
I was forced to succumb under the weight of the pain.

174
00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:51.860
May he be always blessed, and may everything be for his glory in everything and always.

175
00:15:51.860 --> 00:16:00.560
So I want to give you Ephesians chapter 3 verses 20 and 21.

176
00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:04.200
And now we come to a very important moment in volume 3.

177
00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:07.960
It's February the 26th, 1900.

178
00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:17.640
And this is the very first deep teaching on divine will in these volumes.

179
00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:22.320
After going through several days of privation, at most Jesus would come sometimes like a

180
00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:25.000
shadow and would run away.

181
00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:29.680
I felt such pain that I consumed myself with tears.

182
00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:35.880
Now in higher volumes, the tears will be completely gone, she won't even remember them.

183
00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:41.400
Having compassion for my sorrow, blessed Jesus came, and he looked and looked at me

184
00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:49.280
again, and he said to me, "My daughter, do not fear, for I do not leave you."

185
00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:53.040
That's the book of Joshua chapter 1 verse 5.

186
00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:58.280
And 1 Corinthians 3, 16, "No you not that you are the temple of the living God, and that

187
00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:01.360
the Spirit of God dwells in you."

188
00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:09.640
However, when you are without my felt presence is what you would have to say, I do not want

189
00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:14.640
you to lose heart, but rather from today onwards.

190
00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:18.960
When you are deprived of me, see this is why I only want to give you the deep privation

191
00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:24.240
bit by bit, let us get it the way Louisa got it.

192
00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:29.200
When you are deprived of me, I want you to take my divine will.

193
00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:32.260
I want you to delight in my will.

194
00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:38.160
I want you to love me and glorify me in my will.

