00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:44.000
And holding my will as if it was my very person, which it is, the divine will is the

196
00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:47.040
essence of God.

197
00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:52.200
By doing so, you will help me in your own hands.

