00:59:04.400 --> 00:59:10.040
And when the purification is over, then the painful aspect of it disappears and they move

656
00:59:10.040 --> 00:59:14.560
into the glorious and celebratory part of God's love.

657
00:59:14.560 --> 00:59:18.800
It's just a new image of purgatory, isn't it?

658
00:59:18.800 --> 00:59:23.300
So the soul said, in fact, for us, it's not like for you.

659
00:59:23.300 --> 00:59:26.000
You can exercise your free will.

660
00:59:26.000 --> 00:59:29.680
For us, every will has ceased.

661
00:59:29.680 --> 00:59:37.600
Our will is only the will of God and from it we live in it we find our contentment and

662
00:59:37.600 --> 00:59:42.800
the will of God forms all our good and our glory.

663
00:59:42.800 --> 00:59:47.960
And as she was showing in unspeakable contentment talking about the will of God, we separated

664
00:59:47.960 --> 00:59:49.200
Louisa said.

665
00:59:49.200 --> 00:59:55.840
Now, I think this is a most wonderful, wonderful picture of the souls in purgatory that's very

666
00:59:55.840 --> 01:00:00.960
different to most people's image of them.

667
01:00:00.960 --> 01:00:06.160
I think it deserves to be read over and over again.

668
01:00:06.160 --> 01:00:10.960
And I'll just give you a little illustration, it's probably a million miles away from the

669
01:00:10.960 --> 01:00:15.800
reality that they're experiencing, but then I've never been to purgatory.

670
01:00:15.800 --> 01:00:20.840
If you've ever been in the presence of a very holy person, now, I don't just mean the physical

671
01:00:20.840 --> 01:00:24.960
presence as in you stand beside them for five minutes.

672
01:00:24.960 --> 01:00:31.600
But if you have to deal with a very holy person, their holiness shows up your unholyness.

673
01:00:31.600 --> 01:00:35.280
They're not doing anything about it, they're just being themselves.

674
01:00:35.280 --> 01:00:39.400
Their love shows up your own love.

675
01:00:39.400 --> 01:00:44.560
Their sacrificial way of doing things shows up your selfishness.

676
01:00:44.560 --> 01:00:52.120
And so your experience of being in that presence is uncomfortable and challenging.

677
01:00:52.120 --> 01:00:56.080
And that's the description that's given to us here of the souls in purgatory, that their

678
01:00:56.080 --> 01:01:02.920
experience of brushing up against this divine love is uncomfortable and challenging and

679
01:01:02.920 --> 01:01:11.520
painful, but gradually, gradually, gradually, they mold into it and they become like that

680
01:01:11.520 --> 01:01:12.520
which they worship.

681
01:01:12.520 --> 01:01:14.760
I'm going to stop there for a while.
